<title>FRANCE: Seita first half net attrib profit rises.</title>
<headline>Seita first half net attrib profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   389.6  vs	   314.3</p>
<p>    Operating				    566.9  vs	   504.5</p>
<p>    Turnover (consolidated)		  8,493  vs	   8,105</p>
<p>NOTE - Seita issued the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
